hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1841","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1842","Malik related to me that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1843","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that the Messenger of Allah"
"1844","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Muadh al- Ashali al-Ansari that his grandmother said"
"1845","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that a beggar asked A'isha"
"1846","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"1847","Malik related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi from Abu Said al-Khudri that some people of the Ansar asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1848","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1849","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1850","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1851","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man of the Banu Asad said"
"1852","Yahya related that Malik heard al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1853","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1854","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1855","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"